# Artifacts the unit test binary writes into the directory it is run from.
# Anchored to the repository root on purpose: terrain.amrwind and
# forest.amrwind are real tracked inputs under test/test_files/, and an
# unanchored pattern would silently stop a new test case adding one.
/terrain.amrwind
/forest.amrwind
/forest_points.dat
/post_processing/
